WEBVTT

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.220
She's in our class...

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:13.570
<b>Whud</b>

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.660
A-Are you okay?

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.060
Entrance Exam 
Admission Card

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.750
Y-You...

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.850
Leave me alone!

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.010
The school isn't that way!

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.060
Good morning, Hibari-chan!

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.680
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.480
Is something the matter?

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.870
W-Well, I've seen her before...

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.770
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.920
I remember her now.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.850
I can't believe we're in the same class...

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:05.960
Which way is the school?

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:40.240
<b>April 28</b>

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:41.680
All right, today, we're going to begin

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:45.680
Class 1-7's special "happiness 
training" curriculum.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.140
<i>She's not here yet.</i>

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:54.060
For our first lesson, we'll all be 
playing a fun game of dice together.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.060
<b>Happiness Training Dice Game</b>

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.270
Huh?

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:59.030
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:59.030
<b>April 28</b>

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:59.030
<b>My First Happiness Training</b>

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.530
That sounds fun!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.730
Indeed it does.

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:04.110
We won't even have to worry

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:07.160
about accidents or injuries 
if we're playing a board game.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:10.040
And there won't be any 
explosions, right? No kabooms.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.040
It's just... dice?

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.640
That's pretty intense.

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:14.670
Now, let's head to Class 1-7's 
extracurricular training facility.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:18.170
Training facility?

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:21.180
<b>Murmur Murmur Murmur Murmur</b>

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.040
We're playing dice in here?

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.930
This is the gym, isn't it?

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:38.280
This way. The facility is underground.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:40.150
Sorry we're late!

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:44.540
You're late, Hagyu Hibiki-san 
and Ekoda Ren-san.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:45.530
Sorry.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.820
What is this?

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:48.950
An elevator.

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:56.090
Going down.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.600
I wonder where we're going.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:02.990
I'm sorry.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:05.820
The elevator is giving me motion sickness...

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:04.760
Botan-chan! Are you okay?

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:05.610
Are you okay?

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:06.470
Do you need medicine?

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.620
It's an underground world!

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:10.620
<b>Class 1-7 Extracurricular Training Facility</b>

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:15.630
Where are we?

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:22.570
Welcome to the...

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:26.780
Timothy Town!

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:30.790
Wow! It's like an amusement park!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.010
Oh, my...

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:33.000
What is this?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.210
A life-sized dice game.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:38.890
Life-sized?

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:42.800
In this game, you will be the playing pieces.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:46.760
A game of dice is the perfect way
to improve your fortune.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.380
Really?

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.200
There's no way!

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:50.200
I get it!

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.020
Playing a game like this 
for class doesn't make sense.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:57.900
Then would you rather test your 
luck with Russian Roulette?

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:03.140
Good. Now, let's get started.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:04.680
Up, up!

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:06.660
Please form groups of two or three.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.000
Hibari-chan, Botan-chan!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.970
Fine. Let's team up.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:11.620
Yes, please.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:13.640
Just so you know,

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:19.240
the results of your happiness training 
will be reflected on your report cards,

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:21.090
so make sure you do your best.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.550
She's a demon!

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.480
I wonder how they grade our fortune.

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:29.120
Perhaps by "very lucky," 
"moderately lucky," "luck to come,"

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.760
"bad luck," or "very bad luck."

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.770
In other words, whoever reaches the goal first

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:39.190
will receive a perfect 100-point score, right?

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:42.440
Then I, Hagyu Hibiki, will be the winner!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.360
I, Hagyu Hibiki, will rule over this school

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.480
and become its queen!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:51.020
When it comes to contests, 
I never lose to any—

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.520
Please continue, ma'am.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.530
Of course.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.410
They're an unusual pair, aren't they?

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:02.410
Y-Yeah. We don't want to get
bad grades ourselves, though.

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:03.930
We should...

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:15.220
It's on a large scale, 
but it's an ordinary dice game.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.420
Next team, please.

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:19.200
Toss the die!

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.160
Okay!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.680
What?

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:24.000
I... N-Never mind.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.690
Then here I go!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.030
Well, this is how these things always start.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:35.040
<b>Arrive Here</b>

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:35.040
The first step!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.540
<b>Lose a Turn</b>

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.520
<b>Lose a Turn</b>

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:41.480
Hah! Losing a turn on your first roll?

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.380
What a disgrace.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:48.510
Just watch as I, Hibiki, seize victory!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:49.560
What?

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.370
S-So cool!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.840
Hibiki-chan! We haven't talked before, right?

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:56.570
I'm Hanakoizumi Anne!

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.430
Hey! You can't just casually call me by name!

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.670
I don't intend to make friends with anyone!

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.060
Except for Ren!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.440
Ren? Isn't that...

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.470
Ekoda Ren.

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:07.440
Nice to meet you.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.650
N-Nice to meet you, too.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:09.980
R-Ren!

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:11.020
It's a pleasure.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:11.410
<b>Crack</b>

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:17.770
Enough! We don't need to make friends with—

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.260
We'll never get anywhere at this rate.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:22.880
I'm rolling the die.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.220
All right! A six!

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.500
Way to go, Ren!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.340
I'm not so sure.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:31.550
Let's go! Let's take our 
first step towards glory!

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.550
<b>Rrrumble</b>

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.240
<b>Lost
Child</b>

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.230
Just a little mistake, that's all!

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.750
So she has a poor sense of direction?

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.070
Sure seems like it.

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:50.350
Ren!

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:52.720
It'll be faster if I take you there.

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:53.780
But...

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.750
How heartwarming.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:05.690
The first team to roll a six 
receives a special opportunity!

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.700
Complete the task on the square, 
and you go straight to the goal!

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:09.710
R-Really?

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.290
Your task is... Ta-da-da!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.250
You each must shout the name 
of the person you love!

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.640
That's one of the tasks?!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.280
Wh-Wha—

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:20.330
I don't love anyone.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:21.180
Ren!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:21.770
<b>Shock</b>

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:24.830
Now, Hagyu-san, how about you?

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:30.540
I... I don't...

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.400
love anyone!

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.740
Naughty students who not only fail

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:46.120
to complete their tasks, but also tell lies,

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.790
receive a penalty.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.420
There is nothing normal about this.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.270
A pickled plum!

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:53.420
Are you hungry?

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:56.010
Here, Botan-chan. You're next.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.300
Thank you.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:58.680
My foot!

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:00.750
Botan-chan, are you okay?

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:04.160
Need a bandage? A splint? A shot?

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:04.640
I'm sorry. It's heavier than I thought...

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.560
Oh, my. Another six.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.760
Okay, let's go.

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:14.580
Watch your step.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:20.350
It's time for the Thrilling Cosplay Roulette!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.480
C-Cosplay?

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:22.970
That sounds fun!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:27.420
Push the button to stop the wheel!

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.780
I'm so excited!

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:39.600
Wh-Why am I dressed like this?

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:42.190
Hibari-chan, you look super cute!

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:43.930
Yes, you do.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.350
Unlike me, you look wonderful...

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:53.630
Oh, but then again, I would have 
made a disgusting bunny girl,

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:56.360
so perhaps this was just right for me.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.120
A squid!

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.520
Bigfin reef squid? Spear squid?

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.280
Flying squid? Firefly squid?

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.440
I'm a giant squid.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:04.940
You guys are so lucky!

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:07.620
I'm the only one who didn't get anything.

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:10.590
You can have this.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.530
Not wearing it makes me feel a little better.

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:14.980
Thanks!

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:16.520
On to the next activity!

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:18.700
The Hippity Hoppity Jump Rope Game!

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:22.270
You won't be able to proceed
until you complete 500 total jumps.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:23.640
Good luck.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.340
Ready...

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:32.690
My shins!

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:33.990
Botan?

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:35.770
I'm sorry...

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:38.700
I'm sorry I'm such a nauseatingly useless squid...

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:42.320
Hibari-chan...

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:44.830
Sorry. I got tangled up...

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.920
Oh, come on!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:50.160
How did this happen?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.180
We spent too much time on that.

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:56.300
We need to hurry...

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:58.600
Glory lies just ahead.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:01.010
Where are we?

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.040
Too bad. You're in the Infinite Loop Area.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:04.720
What?!

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.640
That was a greater adventure than I expected...

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:14.690
Alligators and swamps...

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:18.320
But the real battle is only just beginning!

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:19.900
One?!

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:22.140
One...

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.640
It's the second Cosplay Roulette of the day!

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:26.540
Cosplay?

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:29.500
A bunny suit?

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.550
<i>Ren was in charge of taking care
of the rabbits in grade school.</i>

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:37.210
<i>She loves them so much, 
she even has three at home.</i>

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:43.840
<i>If I can show myself off in a sexy bunny suit,</i>

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.390
<i>will Ren find me irresistible?</i>

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.010
Come on, bunny!

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:50.830
Which will you choose?

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:53.060
It's the Heaven or Hell Game!

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.550
Pulling one rope will drop a wash basin.

00:11:55.550 --> 00:12:00.330
Pulling the other will drop something
Hanakoizumi-san loves.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:01.280
Something I love?!

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:04.120
H-Hanako, let me...

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:04.120
What could it be?

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:05.850
It's okay, Hibari-chan.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:08.240
I have a feeling luck is on my side.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:11.750
I think you just triggered a flag of some sort...

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:13.340
Here I go!

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:18.410
Wow, puppies and kitties!

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:19.420
Huh? She got it right?!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.880
Hanako!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.760
In your case, both of those choices were wrong.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.840
Hanako-san, are you hurt?

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:32.560
I'm fine...

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.920
Just fine...

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.020
This isn't good.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:38.480
We're not landing on the square 
that takes us out of the loop.

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:41.020
We keep going in circles.

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:43.640
I'm feeling sick again...

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:45.450
At this rate...

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:50.520
We finally caught you.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:54.370
And before you try it, don't say a word
about my temporary appearance.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:57.240
It's a bear! How cute!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.410
Your tiger outfit is wonderful, too.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.160
Thanks...

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.360
I told you not to go there!

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.870
Looks like you're trapped in the Infinite Loop.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.300
You poor things.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.260
You're worried about us?

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.060
You're so nice, Hibiki-chan!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.270
Why would I worry about you people?!

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.070
You just watch! I'll make a comeback!

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:22.600
How's that?

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:25.400
The word "loss" isn't in my dictionary!

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:28.200
Your dictionary must be defective.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:31.640
Hibiki-chan, you're such a cute bear.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.410
I told you not to call me that!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.410
Grr! Grr! Grr!

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:39.380
At this rate, we really will earn 
the worst grades in the class.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:46.090
How are you in front of us?!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.680
What kind of trick did you use?!

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.680
We haven't even moved yet.

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:55.640
<b>Loop Area</b>

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.840
And what are you still doing in the loop area?

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:56.520
Since you rolled a four, 
you should've made it out...

00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:01.160
Ren! Why didn't you stop me?

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:04.010
You kept talking to them,

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.110
so I thought you wanted to stay with them.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.610
I only want to be with you, Ren!

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.240
We have an announcement.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.260
You're taking too long.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:18.560
<b>Goal</b>

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:18.410
All the other teams have finished already.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.040
What?!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.500
Everyone's so good at dice games.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.250
That's not the issue here.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.860
At this rate, second period 
will end before you finish.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:30.930
It looks like using a dice game to 
determine last place will take too long.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:33.280
Let's move on to a competition.

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:34.840
A competition?

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:40.810
It's okay. Don't be scared.

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:44.270
Now, let's advance to the final stage.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.780
It's too dark to see...

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.400
That was fun!

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:01.710
Dried squid!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:08.440
I was so scared the arm would snap or shatter.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.290
Uh-huh.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:07.100
Uh-huh. I know.

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:09.100
Uh-huh. I understand.

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:11.800
I think that took 40 years off my life...

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.560
Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.090
You're letting it get to you too much!

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:18.310
How cute!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.270
Don't laugh!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.590
I'm sorry, Hagyu-san.

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:25.800
There's nowhere else to grab the bear suit.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:27.710
Then let me ride the gondola, too!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.950
Hibiki, if you struggle too much...

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:35.800
See?

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:38.950
I told you so.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.140
R-Ren...

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:47.460
Sorry. You're too heavy.

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.730
I'll go on a diet.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:51.420
Do your best.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:56.810
Welcome to the stage that will determine 
the most unfortunate students in the class!

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:03.550
You will compete in three tests 
of luck given to you by Timothy.

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:06.020
Your total scores will determine 
who wins and who loses.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:10.860
By the way, Hibarigaoka-san, 
how did you enjoy the dice game?

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:15.470
Well, I'm glad I didn't land on 
that first square, about who I—

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:19.600
I mean, I'm glad I didn't land 
on any personal questions.

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:20.860
I see.

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:23.200
In that case, I'll incorporate 
that into this game.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.000
<i>Crap!</i>

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.040
Furthermore, there's a special assignment

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.130
waiting for the team that places last.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.960
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:35.130
<i>Even if we win this game, 
we'll be second to last...</i>

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:39.180
<i>Rather than settling for such
a lackluster ranking,</i>

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:43.820
<i>I, Hagyu Hibiki, will succeed in finishing last!</i>

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:47.400
<i>Her pride is leading her in 
some weird direction again.</i>

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.400
Last place will be mine!

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:51.690
Let's get started.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.260
The first game is...

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:55.820
The Nom Nom Yummy Bread Race!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.370
So many Timothys!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.390
They're so tiny and cute.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:01.750
They're Timothy Town's staff.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.500
First through third place will score points.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.190
I don't care what we're doing!

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:09.710
<i>I don't intend to win either way!</i>

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.210
I can't afford to lose.

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.720
Ready...

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.890
Hey, hey! Can I have the melon bread?

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:17.840
Take what you want!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:18.640
All right!

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:23.440
It is yummy!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.440
By the way, one piece of bread

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.830
is filled with wasabi.

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:28.560
<i>Hanako...</i>

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:33.180
I can't collapse before the end again...

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.820
<i>I'm glad I can't move well in this.</i>

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.570
<i>I can place last without
being obvious about it.</i>

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.120
My front teeth!

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:41.280
I heard a really loud noise.

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:42.870
My teeth...

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.640
Hanakoizumi-san and Kumegawa-san...

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:53.080
They're out.

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:59.300
<b>Hibarigaoka Team</b>

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:59.300
<b>Ekoda Team</b>

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:59.300
Ekoda and Hagyu's team leads by one point.

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:02.640
<i>They're doing even worse than I imagined.</i>

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:04.620
The second game is...

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:06.560
The Chocolate Stick Game!

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:07.350
Do you mean...

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:11.710
That's right. You'll eat a single 
chocolate stick from both ends.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:13.940
That's shameless!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.220
It's only a game.

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:19.450
When time is called, the team with 
the shortest stick will be the winner.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.910
If yours breaks, you lose.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.560
Line up, please.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:26.410
There's one long stick and one short stick.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.130
So the short stick has an advantage...

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:30.120
<i>Gulp...</i>

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:34.620
All right!

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.820
Is this really what we want?

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:36.820
Looks tasty!

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:38.940
Who wants to go?

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:42.050
I don't think I can use my mouth...

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.510
Then it's me and Hibari-chan.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:45.740
I guess we have no choice.

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:47.510
Let's eat as much as we can!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.020
<i>This time I can definitely lose.</i>

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:50.980
Ready, and...

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:56.140
I can't do it!

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:58.170
We're going to lose, Hibari-chan!

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.450
But... Don't you get it?

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.660
You don't get it!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.180
What are they doing?

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:07.640
Focus.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:09.580
Hey, wait...

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.040
Here we go.

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:24.630
Sorry. I was too aggressive and broke it.

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:26.840
What's wrong?

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.600
Ren...

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.060
You idiot!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.390
<i>This is our chance.</i>

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:33.880
<i>I just have to do this...</i>

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.960
Oops, I ate the whole thing.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.600
Wh-What are you thinking?!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.720
It was so yummy...

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.210
It's a tie.

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.760
Is this... a quiz game?

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:47.340
Yeah. Since second period is ending now,

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:49.530
there will only be one question.

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:51.620
The score is currently 1-0.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:55.900
If Hibarigaoka-san's team wins, you'll be tied,

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:58.960
so we're multiplying your points by ten.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.630
I'd appreciate that, but are you okay with it?

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.960
It's no problem at all.

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:07.840
After all, your team is absolutely worthless!

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:09.810
What's she getting mad at us for?

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:14.770
Inside this box is a question 
that's advantageous for one team.

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:17.270
This will be today's final test of luck.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.090
My, my...

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:25.000
You're not very lucky, Hibarigaoka-san.

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:26.160
Could it be...

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:27.770
Here's your question.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:32.910
"Shout the name of the person 
you love more than anything."

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:37.880
Hagyu-san's team wasn't able 
to answer this earlier, though.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:38.970
Despite how it seems,

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:42.380
this is rather fortunate for 
your team, Hibarigaoka-san.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.010
<i>That's right.</i>

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.680
<i>Nothing could be harder to say
than the name of the person I love.</i>

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:50.850
<i>Now hurry up and lead me to last place!</i>

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:54.280
<i>The teacher knows about him.</i>

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:55.810
<i>I can't lie...</i>

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:57.940
<i>But they're...</i>

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.310
<i>If I don't answer it, we'll be last.</i>

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:05.340
<i>But... But...</i>

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:10.280
I... I...

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:15.880
I love Iriomote cats!

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:25.550
I said to name a person, you brat.

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:28.510
Hibarigaoka's team places last!

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:29.630
Huh?

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:30.680
Oh, my...

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:35.640
Second... to last...

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:35.660
<b>2nd Place</b>

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:38.030
We were unsucc-squid-ful.

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:39.750
You're right.

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.650
I was trying to make it a squid pun.

00:21:41.490 --> 00:21:43.060
<i>Did she do that for me?</i>

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:45.150
I'm sorry it was difficult to understand...

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:47.610
Sorry, guys.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:52.620
I'm sure there'll be more happiness training.

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:55.450
We'll try harder next time.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:59.850
Now it's time for your penalty homework.

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:01.420
Oh, right...

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:04.010
Your assignment is...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>April 29</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>A Mysterious Penalty</b>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:43.020
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
